    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PHANTOM is a Single Player Ghost Hunting game,</strong><br><strong>With over 10 Planned Locations Inspired by Real, and Unusual Places,</strong><br><strong>Like Pirate Ships and Cave Systems.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>20 Different Ghost Types, with 3 Evidence Per Ghost Type. and 11 Evidence Total. </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>With a EMF Reader, Thermometer, UV Light, Spirit box, Parabolic Mic, and Camera as your Main Evidence Items.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <u><strong>The Safe House\u00a0 </strong></u><br> <br><strong>At the Computer,</strong>You'll be able to Upgrade your equipment, And start investigations. <br>    <br><strong>Player Upgrades,</strong>  <br>You'll be able to upgrade all of the Equipment Items,   <br>From Better Range, to quicker activation, and more accurate results   <br>And the Player,  From faster walk speed, to better visibility in the Dark.   <br>    </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Single Player only.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Made in Unreal Engine 5.6</strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PHANTOM is a Single Player Ghost Hunting game,</strong><br><strong>With over 10 Planned Locations Inspired by Real, and Unusual Places,</strong><br><strong>Like Pirate Ships and Cave Systems.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>20 Different Ghost Types, with 3 Evidence Per Ghost Type. and 11 Evidence Total. </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>With a EMF Reader, Thermometer, UV Light, Spirit box, Parabolic Mic, and Camera as your Main Evidence Items.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <u><strong>The Safe House\u00a0 </strong></u><br> <br><strong>At the Computer,</strong>You'll be able to Upgrade your equipment, And start investigations. <br>    <br><strong>Player Upgrades,</strong>  <br>You'll be able to upgrade all of the Equipment Items,   <br>From Better Range, to quicker activation, and more accurate results   <br>And the Player,  From faster walk speed, to better visibility in the Dark.   <br>    </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Single Player only.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Made in Unreal Engine 5.6</strong></p>",
